### Telemetry

JSON telemetry output available via USB Serial.

Example:

```json
{
  "device": "DrillVision",
  "version": "4.17",
  "timestamp": 15230,
  "roll": 0.12,
  "pitch": -0.35,
  "battery": 100.0,
  "temperature": 23.5,
  "wifi": false,
  "usb": false,
  "charging": false,
  "state": "IM LOT"
}
```

